=== Packet Decoder ===

Test 1: ping, no payload
  OK: type=ping seq=1 payload=0 bytes
Test 2: data, 32 bytes
  OK: type=data seq=100 payload=32 bytes
Test 3: ack, 8 bytes, extract payload
  OK: type=ack seq=200 payload=8 bytes
  extracted 8 bytes
  owner-bound view agrees with the copy
Test 4: truncated (5 bytes)
  FAIL: packet too short
Test 5: bad version
  FAIL: bad version
Test 6: bad checksum
  FAIL: checksum mismatch

All tests passed.
